{
    "name": "E2E RoomPriceGenie - inventory",
    "description": "Sends the inventory (two room types, one rate plan) of the connected sandbox property with Send Inventory.",
    "notes": {
        "bd9de492-9e2b-4600-8195-20c1533b2479": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 208,
            "width": 880,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## Never run\n\nThis flow was written from RoomPriceGenie's documentation and has only passed `appmixer e2e validate`. No RoomPriceGenie test account existed when it was written. See README.md in this folder for what a run needs.\n\n## ⚠️ Replaces the whole inventory\n\n`inventory.update` replaces all room types and rate plans of the connected property; anything not in this flow is un-mapped in RoomPriceGenie. Run it only with a connection of a **sandbox property made for this test**, never with a real hotel.\n\nAfter the first run the room types `E2E-DBL` and `E2E-SGL` and the rate plan `E2E-BAR` must be mapped in the RoomPriceGenie sandbox account (Room Setup → Setup All Rooms), or by RoomPriceGenie's team. The flow \"E2E RoomPriceGenie - ari updates\" needs that mapping."
        }
    },
    "flow": {
